{{!
    @template local_dimensions/setting_unaccent

    The state of the PostgreSQL unaccent extension in the plugin settings, with the button that
    creates it when it is missing.

    Context variables required:
    * state (string) - Localised sentence stating the current state.

    Context variables optional:
    * control (string) - Rendered create button; trusted HTML from the core renderer, empty when
      there is nothing to offer.

    @copyright  2026 Anderson Blaine
    @license    http://www.gnu.org/copyleft/gpl.html GNU GPL v3 or later

    Example context (json):
    {
        "state": "The unaccent extension is not installed.",
        "control": "<button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">Create the extension</button>"
    }
}}
<p class="mb-2">{{state}}</p>
{{#control}}
    {{{control}}}
{{/control}}
